{"id": "bgdb:resources.assets:320/sheet/t0mvbnMW90imSoe6SezMKA/row/XYi6qn2sRE2eay06g986AQ/field/gt2E0tKZz0yCT5P2xrS3sA", "selectors": [{"asset": "resources.assets", "fieldId": "gt2E0tKZz0yCT5P2xrS3sA", "kind": "bg", "pathId": 320, "rowId": "XYi6qn2sRE2eay06g986AQ", "sheetId": "t0mvbnMW90imSoe6SezMKA"}], "source": "Go find a few critters Scarlett wants you to meet.", "context": {"selectors": [{"asset": "resources.assets", "fieldId": "gt2E0tKZz0yCT5P2xrS3sA", "kind": "bg", "pathId": 320, "rowId": "XYi6qn2sRE2eay06g986AQ", "sheetId": "t0mvbnMW90imSoe6SezMKA"}]}, "consumerContext": [], "sourceSha256": "24739448e7e9daf805f5f51d2818e78f2c2a76d74883db01cadb252c504dfa59", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "Знайди кількох звірят, з якими Скарлетт хоче тебе познайомити.", "targetSha256": "f4ee28fbeba9b15398c489dea79c48a9d6d41c8131c567b8b6355f5f4af41372"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:127:275:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/32/dialogueEntries/21/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/32/dialogueEntries/21/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=1]I’ve heard a few critters have already been hooking up!", "context": {"actorId": "2", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act2/coyoteQuest/04a_ScarlettBuckyDatesIntroduction", "conversationId": 127, "entryId": 275, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[127, 276], [127, 284]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "3bfb856e937cfbbc52c276dfe234804517d24f4c2ce85fe0cb6a50b887d950c0", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=1]Чула, дехто зі звірят уже почав сходитися для розваг!", "targetSha256": "146a33af204ed46491ee8520945ed2bb74bd4e49e1e0c3752f9d2837d43892cd"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:127:299:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/32/dialogueEntries/45/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/32/dialogueEntries/45/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=1]You’ll probably be seein’ more critters visiting each other too!", "context": {"actorId": "3", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act2/coyoteQuest/04a_ScarlettBuckyDatesIntroduction", "conversationId": 127, "entryId": 299, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "e44203807bebf5b3080239be9a627622c7799ddaddcf8720a820742699a25c80", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=1]Напевно, побачиш і більше звірят, що навідуються одне до одного!", "targetSha256": "6f05746b610f1a99fca352bb3380f5cf49361b186cabd2f7b1e152111fa39452"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:1444:963:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/495/dialogueEntries/61/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/495/dialogueEntries/61/fields/6/value"}], "source": "*The critters take turns climbing and sniffing about. A few critters hop on his head.*", "context": {"actorId": "7", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/oliverCumSpaStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 1444, "entryId": 963, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[1444, 964]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "593926368756f2c5760b23810bc646eb7996d120df41f8015555de51d339557c", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "*Звірята по черзі лазять по ньому й обнюхують. Декілька стрибають йому на голову.*", "targetSha256": "17cbfe331de43aaccac3c5292b9b265f2c027894b2c4ad17a3794d83b5b5778e"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:256:201:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/53/dialogueEntries/8/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/53/dialogueEntries/8/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=4]There’s a couple of critters that live far out on the other side of the clearing too.", "context": {"actorId": "15", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act2/donkeyQuest/01_meetTheDonkey", "conversationId": 256, "entryId": 201, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[256, 202]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "983305031ac896c47448bc04711ed3066e284e86426954ecdf4bae9b0c90e60a", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=4]Ще двоє звірят живуть далеко на іншому боці галявини.", "targetSha256": "6171af4b5b7a909e11d027a0b0ce7a70c1413823ac2b30072fd71be3dd6b4cfd"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:290:200:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/52/dialogueEntries/5/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/52/dialogueEntries/5/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Sort of… a few critters needed it…", "context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "6", "conversation": "act2/deliveryQuest/09_returnToOtter", "conversationId": 290, "entryId": 200, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[290, 201]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "5f382a8efceab62644ba7df6776f5c1854df806f117a0a2c2ae5c83fb5ce3e12", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "Начебто… вона потрібна кільком звірятам…", "targetSha256": "ed03ed5ef3e2b4af2f1e48803ab8c96d2ffe1e7579d47f67055613ebd9afc2f3"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:517:987:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/546/dialogueEntries/44/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/546/dialogueEntries/44/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=2]I know he’s been wanting to open up to more critters recently. <pause>This could be a good opportunity!", "context": {"actorId": "2", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/wolfQuest/02_askAround_bunnies", "conversationId": 517, "entryId": 987, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[517, 988]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "b0b00b27b13870929beda82f6e193f75a39d45c0c6fe91718bee5429b4ed3760", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=2]Знаю, останнім часом він хотів відкритися більшій кількості звірят. <pause>Це може бути гарна нагода!", "targetSha256": "ec47f08b0ae3ab12a14846c48ef5530eb9d3b5ad6125357c8294221d9378e781"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:67:97:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/283/dialogueEntries/3/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/283/dialogueEntries/3/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=2]Y’know, being a small gal, I’ve messed around with a few big critters in that way before!", "context": {"actorId": "5", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "vslice/otterQuest/soundingGetFromMouse", "conversationId": 67, "entryId": 97, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[67, 98]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "6640f828049da2ee8b6c091f7f0e21e6ee9d1450051e3b2b3e9e06f5ed655bd8", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=2]Знаєш, я дівчина маленька, тож уже так бавилася з кількома великими звірятами!", "targetSha256": "6f9fcb79609778777907fb9c42a90aa1b89b71da459de1c68a81837e8c54cc12"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:934:812:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/465/dialogueEntries/15/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/465/dialogueEntries/15/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=2]Right? And one of these days it’ll be ready for a lot more critters!", "context": {"actorId": "2", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/bootyLineUpQuest/03_returnToBunnies", "conversationId": 934, "entryId": 812, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[934, 813]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "2c26427744a79795856f08fb8e92f65748901d01356501693248aac7aa8919db", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=2]Правда ж? А якось тут буде місце для значно більшої кількості звірят!", "targetSha256": "9d7b959941700ec90e3b4cf656c6037d5261df37189e8b9b6e85a45843da1893"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:957:493:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/488/dialogueEntries/64/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/488/dialogueEntries/64/fields/6/value"}], "source": "How about I go next? I’m sure\nthe more critters they meet,\nthe easier it will become!", "context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "5", "conversation": "act3/maverickSideHustleQuest/03_mabelExplains", "conversationId": 957, "entryId": 493, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[957, 494]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "fb440f42a1a04ed774b351881c5ec680a021a9f55382c83d7be32fd23f34866e", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "А може, наступним піду я? Певен,\nщо більше звірят вони зустрінуть,\nто легше їм буде!", "targetSha256": "81250e6237ac7f3d0bfb3636a1070e8975691dc8f0d3137cbd94816ccfc5a0bc"}
{"id": "managed:Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll:System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2<TheForestOfLove.Narrative.AdventureType,TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Adventure> TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Adventure::RegenerateAdventuresPleaseMoveThisDataToDbSoItsNotStaticBruh()@80", "selectors": [{"asset": "Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll", "index": 80, "kind": "managed", "method": "System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2<TheForestOfLove.Narrative.AdventureType,TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Adventure> TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Adventure::RegenerateAdventuresPleaseMoveThisDataToDbSoItsNotStaticBruh()"}], "source": "The bunnies upgraded their basement dungeon and want to host more critters. This time, recruit some female critters to join the fun!", "context": {"selectors": [{"asset": "Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll", "index": 80, "kind": "managed", "method": "System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2<TheForestOfLove.Narrative.AdventureType,TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Adventure> TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Adventure::RegenerateAdventuresPleaseMoveThisDataToDbSoItsNotStaticBruh()"}]}, "consumerContext": [], "sourceSha256": "4b91c25c884690d608e748c125df9c1448d02d2be6d3f630bcb92397defccdf7", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "Кролики оновили підземелля у своєму підвалі й хочуть прийняти більше звірят. Цього разу запроси звірят жіночої статі долучитися до розваг!", "targetSha256": "0af63f1d7a34563ebf7dcb3b4956403a0add9264fc14a0b6aed65a44b8023596"}
{"id": "managed:Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll:System.Void TheForestOfLove.Events.TriggerHandlers.TriggerHandlerAct1::ExecuteTrigger(System.String)@522", "selectors": [{"asset": "Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll", "index": 522, "kind": "managed", "method": "System.Void TheForestOfLove.Events.TriggerHandlers.TriggerHandlerAct1::ExecuteTrigger(System.String)"}], "source": "Say hi to four more critters.", "context": {"selectors": [{"asset": "Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll", "index": 522, "kind": "managed", "method": "System.Void TheForestOfLove.Events.TriggerHandlers.TriggerHandlerAct1::ExecuteTrigger(System.String)"}]}, "consumerContext": [], "sourceSha256": "74ace83bbdde8a8427ef15a480f9742f04c42bdf4ecd5dfa7b91f24b645474ff", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "Привітайся ще з чотирма звірятами.", "targetSha256": "5eebb6c20fc9d0f71a6a7305855df1e4ff87428d48cfa4b819b8b991c8cf30f3"}
{"id": "managed:Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll:System.Void TheForestOfLove.QuestLogDetailsPane::UpdateSelectedQuest(TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Quest)@168", "selectors": [{"asset": "Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll", "index": 168, "kind": "managed", "method": "System.Void TheForestOfLove.QuestLogDetailsPane::UpdateSelectedQuest(TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Quest)"}], "source": "More critters {0}{1}{2}{3}{4}.", "context": {"selectors": [{"asset": "Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll", "index": 168, "kind": "managed", "method": "System.Void TheForestOfLove.QuestLogDetailsPane::UpdateSelectedQuest(TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Quest)"}]}, "consumerContext": [], "sourceSha256": "5f99d09af73aa4fea4a5ad24854a721678e8ad082573ae06c9e2c349787dc69f", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "Ще звірята: {0}{1}{2}{3}{4}.", "targetSha256": "66039e61cf58aa920bb2e72c8cc8b0a08e4b4a138ead9c066a0d07a582cd7325"}
{"id": "sharedassets2.assets:14489/m_text", "selectors": [{"asset": "sharedassets2.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 14489, "pointer": "/m_text"}], "source": "As you meet more and more critters, their information will be jotted down in the Critter Log!\r\n\r\nLots of details are hidden. Talk with the critters and explore the world to reveal them!", "context": {"selectors": [{"asset": "sharedassets2.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 14489, "pointer": "/m_text"}]}, "consumerContext": [{"class": "TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI", "classification": "initial-display-value", "componentEnabled": true, "hierarchy": "GossipTutorialRedux/Page5/NameContainer/NameGlowLeft/NameGlowBottom", "id": "sharedassets2.assets:14489/m_text", "value": "As you meet more and more critters, their information will be jotted down in the Critter Log!\r\n\r\nLots of details are hidden. Talk with the critters and explore the world to reveal them!"}], "sourceSha256": "b884416f79ad4402ea93445a7dbaba0c4010f9aa12835f18ea624216e1dfabd8", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "Знайомлячись із новими звірятами, ти поповнюватимеш відомості в Записах про звірят!\r\n\r\nБагато подробиць приховано. Розмовляй зі звірятами й досліджуй світ, щоб їх відкрити!", "targetSha256": "37b133377bcfa60d79a339abadb536b7bcb03e68a3832446601ff58fa8a918ba"}
